### Page 1 of 1

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Richard Kaysen, and City Council
FROM:

Sara Vasquez, Asst. Director of Purchasing
DATE:

October 1, 2013
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #R-5-14, for furnishing One New Mobile Command Unit
for the Cheyenne Police Department.
______________________________________________
There were three (3) bidders respond to this bid, and the bid tab is below.

1. LDV

$177,662.00
Burlington, WI

2. Quality Vans & Specialty Vehicles
$228,019.00
Tempe, AZ

3. Farber Specialty Vehicles

$279,000.00
Reynoldsburg, OH

The bids were reviewed by Nathan Buseck, and Dennis Bell, and their recommendation is to
accept the low bid from LDV, of Burlington, WI for a total bid amount of $177,662.00.

Funding:
024-15-1530-41-85401 (Law Enforcement Grants)
```
